 "id": 587510415578,
 "title": "Guillaume City Bike",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c380\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I am an Engineer in Audio Processing. I would like to change my job for a more meaningful one. I had heard of people doing bamboo bicycles and I thought that was something I could maybe do for a job. I use my bike every day for commuting, so I decided to build one from Bamboo Bicycle kit to see if this was something I could enjoy.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\"></span></h4>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I really enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and I would strongly recommend!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c385\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\"></span></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c385\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Aligning and tacking the rear triangle was the most difficult part. I had to to it twice as the whell was touching the chainstays at first.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\"></span></h4>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\">What was the easiest part of the build?</span></h4>\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\">I would say cutting the bamboos for the front triangle.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c390\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\"></span></h4>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c390\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">It's wonderful, smooth and rigid at the same time. I love it !</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c393\"><span class=\"G4EHhc\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I would like to find a way to have beautiful lugs more easily.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_20210405_182519_-_Guillaume_Denneulin_1.jpg?v=1653059075\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_20210428_155033_-_Guillaume_Denneulin.jpg?v=1653059091\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_20210518_103420_-_Guillaume_Denneulin.jpg?v=1653059131\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
